lues":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot v4.5.stable.official [876b29033] \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6900 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21025.15011) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.91 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using the project manager to create a duplicate of a project, If the user accidentally places the duplicate project inside the folder of the original project the project will try to recursively copy itself. If the project has any large files this will quickly fill up the disk the operation was performed on. Additionally the duplication will never, and can never finish. \n\nI will fully admit this is user error, however it is an easy mistake to make while migrating projects.\n\nA sanity check to ensure the user isn't trying to create the duplicate within the project they are duplicating would prevent this behavior. Godot already prevents you from creating a duplicate project if the parent directory of the path doesn't exist, so this behavior would be in line with that. Alternatively, if the duplicate project function ignored folders with the name of the duplicated project, this would prevent the recursive loop.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI suggest performing this reproduction on an empty flash drive as it makes cleanup easier.\nCreate a project.\nUse the project manager duplicate project function to create a duplicate of the project. Set the Project Path in the duplicate project window to a path within the original projects directory.\nPress duplicate.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[recursion-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22614321/recursion-test.zip)\nYou could just use the new project dialog to create this, there is nothing unique about the project file.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111063/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111063/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}